$JOB
.DELETE *.LS
.DELETE *.BN

/ First build the CAPS system components...
.R PAL8
*C2BOOT,C2BOOT<C2BOOT
.R PAL8
*MONTOR,MONTOR<CASMON
.R PAL8
*SYSCOP,SYSCOP<SYSCOP
.R PAL8
*EDITC,EDITC<EDITC
.R PAL8
*CBASIC,CBASIC<CBASIC/K
.R PAL8
*PALC,PALC<PALC
.R PAL8
*UTIL,UTIL<UTIL
.R PAL8
*BOOT,BOOT<BOOT
.R PAL8
*CODT,CODT<CODT

/ Build the MCPIP program (we need it to build the cassette!)
.PAL MCPIP,MCPIP<MCPIP
.LOAD MCPIP=12000
.SAVE SYS MCPIP

/ Build the tape...
$MSG Ready to build CAPS8 system.  Mount tape on CSA0.
.R MCPIP
*CSA0:</Z
*CSA0:C2BOOT<C2BOOT/B=10000
*CSA0:MONTOR<MONTOR/B=20000
*CSA0:SYSCOP<SYSCOP/B=20000
*CSA0:EDIT<EDITC/B=10000
*CSA0:BASIC<CBASIC/B=10000
*CSA0:PALC<PALC/B=20000
*CSA0:UTIL<UTIL/B=10000
*CSA0:BOOT<BOOT/B=30000
*CSA0:CODT.PA<CODT.PA
*TTY:<CSA0:/L

$END
